{
 "encounter_id": "00988",
 "speakers": {
  "person_1": "PATIENT",
  "person_2": "DOCTOR"
 },
 "turns": [
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Hi, doctor. Great to see you. I wanted to ask if I can cut down on my tablets, because my sugar numbers at home have been so much better, and I've been exercising, and my wife says I'm a new man, and, well, I thought it was worth asking."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Congratulations. That's a lot of hard work. How are you feeling in yourself? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Good. A bit dizzy now and then, when I stand up quick."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Anything else?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Hungry between meals. Like clockwork, at eleven."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Have you had any low blood sugar episodes, shakes, sweats?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No, nothing like that."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "What are you taking at the moment?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Metformin, 1000 mg, twice a day."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Any allergies?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Hm. I think I had a reaction to some medicine once, a rash, but I can't remember what it was, or when."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "I'll record it as a possible, unconfirmed allergy. Any other conditions?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Just the diabetes. Type 2."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Let me take your numbers. Blood pressure 124 over 76, weight 82 kilos.",
   "pause": 10.0
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "I've lost seven kilos. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "That's a huge achievement. Any trouble with your heart, palpitations, when you're dizzy?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No, nothing like that."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Here's how I'd think about it. Weight loss and exercise make the body more sensitive to insulin, so you need less medicine. That's the goal. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "So I can cut down? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "A small step. I'd like to reduce your metformin to 500 mg, twice a day."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Half the dose. Is that safe? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Yes, as long as we check. I'd like to arrange an HbA1c in three months, to make sure your sugar stays well controlled."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "That makes sense. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "If your home readings start climbing before then, ring us. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "I will. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "And the dizziness when you stand, drink a glass of water first thing, and stand up slowly."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "I'll do that. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "I'd like to see you again in three months, with the result."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Three months. And can I tell my wife? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Absolutely. She's earned it too. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "She'll be delighted. Thank you. ~"
  }
